@v56 kernel.seq.make item "Fixture literals were read as inert data; no sibling implementation was imported, copied or executed." item "Four Romanian fixtures are translated into English under the English-only project contract. Their original identifiers, semantic content, sentence order and gold positions are retained; they are scored separately from unchanged English." item "Original development/holdout labels are retained as provenance. All fixtures are public and development-visible in SXLM." item "Recall, precision and lead recall preserve the original sentence-index oracle. Exact selection and span checks provide an additional stricter acceptance condition."
